  "summary_en": "Joint high-level cyber risk analysis by ANSSI and partner agencies for the Paris AI Action Summit. It identifies AI-specific attacks (poisoning, extraction, evasion), supply-chain and interconnection risks, and gives voluntary security guidelines and a checklist for AI users, operators, developers and policy-makers.",
